  m_text: 'Welcome, soldier.


    We have to clear this area before anyone else
    gets hurt.

    You''ll need to <color=#FF8383>transport the mines one by one
    to the pit <color=white>on your right.



    Stay focused and handle them with
    extreme caution, or <color=#FF8383>they will explode.<color=white>



    Once
    they are secured in the pit, <color=#FF8383>use the explosive material to detonate
    them<color=white> safely.

'
